UnitQueueLib::RequireUncoveredHead
├── when the withdraw queue is empty
│   └── it should revert with NoQueuedWithdrawal
└── given the withdraw queue holds a head exit
    ├── when the evacuation window has not elapsed since registration
    │   └── it should revert with EvacuationWindowNotElapsed
    └── given the evacuation window has elapsed
        ├── when the free chain zero weight covers the head exit
        │   └── it should revert with HeadIsCovered
        ├── when the head exit is uncovered
        │   └── it should price the head through the principal token supply and pass
        └── when the head exit is uncovered well past the window
            └── it should pass once the window has elapsed with margin
